en:
//　空も良い。空気も良い。
//　これは<RUBY text='いくさ'>戦</RUBY>の気配だと、〝光〟は悟った。

//　既に始まっているのだ。
//　命と命、魂と魂の争剋が――

//　無数の<RUBY text='ひと'>戦士</RUBY>から唯一の<RUBY text='かみ'>覇者</RUBY>を選び出す、武の祭典が！
  She reaches out with all of her senses. The air crackles and thrums with energy.

  She recognizes this as the scent of battle, of souls clashing amid fire and steel. She lets it wash over her, filling her lungs.

  It has begun. The Grand Melee, where all mankind must fight to the last, that the one who remains may claim heaven's throne.

pt:
